        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For sale by private treaty, Newly refurbished mid terrace 3 bedroom two storey town house, offering well laid out accommodation and town center convenience. \r\nThe property which is B energy rated, offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a recently refurbished residence and containing open plan living/kitchen area, sitting room, 3 bedrooms overhead and a family bathroom. \r\nBecause of its size and location the property is ideally suited to owner occupier or investor. \r\nViewing highly recommended and by appointment only."
